{"id":"e714f65d9793749d","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-graph-tensor-product.md","title":"旋转图的张量积","display":"df-graph-tensor-product — 旋转图的张量积","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-graph-tensor-product","aliases":["28-df-graph-tensor-product"],"display":"df-graph-tensor-product — 旋转图的张量积","depends_on":["[[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]","[[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]"],"source_book_location":"§21.3.3","source_printed_pages":"435–436","source_pdf_pages":"461–462","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-graph-tensor-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-graph-tensor-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-graph-tensor-product — 旋转图的张量积"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b6b8966305e02a9\" href=\"?note=0b6b8966305e02a9\" title=\"28-df-regular-rotation-graph\">28-df-regular-rotation-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c9d3a0ba202211c\" href=\"?note=1c9d3a0ba202211c\" title=\"28-df-random-walk-matrix\">28-df-random-walk-matrix</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§21.3.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"435–436"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"461–462"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(N,D,R)\">\\(G=(N,D,R)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=(M,d,S)\">\\(H=(M,d,S)\\)</span> 分别属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D},\\mathsf{RG}_{M,d}\">\\(\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D},\\mathsf{RG}_{M,d}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0b6b8966305e02a9\" href=\"?note=0b6b8966305e02a9\" title=\"28-df-regular-rotation-graph\">28-df-regular-rotation-graph</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prodidx}_{a,b}\">\\(\\operatorname{prodidx}_{a,b}\\)</span> 是下式构造的编号双射。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_G,P_H\">\\(P_G,P_H\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1c9d3a0ba202211c\" href=\"?note=1c9d3a0ba202211c\" title=\"28-df-random-walk-matrix\">28-df-random-walk-matrix</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in[N],v\\in[M],i\\in[D],j\\in[d]\">\\(u\\in[N],v\\in[M],i\\in[D],j\\in[d]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(u,i)=(u_R,i_R)\">\\(R(u,i)=(u_R,i_R)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(v,j)=(v_S,j_S)\">\\(S(v,j)=(v_S,j_S)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prodidx}_{a,b}(r,s)\\coloneqq(r-1)b+s\\quad((r,s)\\in[a]\\times[b]),\\qquad\\operatorname{prodidx}_{a,b}:[a]\\times[b]\\xrightarrow{\\sim}[ab].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{prodidx}_{a,b}(r,s)\\coloneqq(r-1)b+s\\quad((r,s)\\in[a]\\times[b]),\\qquad\\operatorname{prodidx}_{a,b}:[a]\\times[b]\\xrightarrow{\\sim}[ab].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_\\otimes(\\operatorname{prodidx}_{N,M}(u,v),\\operatorname{prodidx}_{D,d}(i,j))\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{prodidx}_{N,M}(u_R,v_S),\\operatorname{prodidx}_{D,d}(i_R,j_S)),\\qquad G\\otimes H\\coloneqq(NM,Dd,R_\\otimes).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_\\otimes(\\operatorname{prodidx}_{N,M}(u,v),\\operatorname{prodidx}_{D,d}(i,j))\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{prodidx}_{N,M}(u_R,v_S),\\operatorname{prodidx}_{D,d}(i_R,j_S)),\\qquad G\\otimes H\\coloneqq(NM,Dd,R_\\otimes).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_\\otimes:[NM]\\times[Dd]\\to[NM]\\times[Dd],\\qquad G\\otimes H\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{NM,Dd}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_\\otimes:[NM]\\times[Dd]\\to[NM]\\times[Dd],\\qquad G\\otimes H\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{NM,Dd}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall u,u&#39;\\in[N]\\ \\forall v,v&#39;\\in[M]\\quad P_{G\\otimes H}(\\operatorname{prodidx}_{N,M}(u&#39;,v&#39;),\\operatorname{prodidx}_{N,M}(u,v))=P_G(u&#39;,u)P_H(v&#39;,v).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall u,u&#39;\\in[N]\\ \\forall v,v&#39;\\in[M]\\quad P_{G\\otimes H}(\\operatorname{prodidx}_{N,M}(u&#39;,v&#39;),\\operatorname{prodidx}_{N,M}(u,v))=P_G(u&#39;,u)P_H(v&#39;,v).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两个分量对合的积仍为对合，故是同类旋转图。一次步独立走两个图，故转移概率相乘。编码双射是显示编号约定，不改变概率和谱。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§21.3.3；印刷页 435–436；PDF 页 461–462。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-regular-rotation-graph","status":"resolved","id":"0b6b8966305e02a9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-random-walk-matrix","status":"resolved","id":"1c9d3a0ba202211c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-regular-rotation-graph","status":"resolved","id":"0b6b8966305e02a9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(N,D,R)$、$H=(M,d,S)$ 分别属于 $\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D},\\mathsf{RG}_{M,d}$，见 [[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]；$a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\operatorname{prodidx}_{a,b}$ 是下式构造的编号双射。$P_G,P_H$ 见 [[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]。$u\\in[N],v\\in[M],i\\in[D],j\\in[d]$；$R(u,i)=(u_R,i_R)$、$S(v,j)=(v_S,j_S)$。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-random-walk-matrix","status":"resolved","id":"1c9d3a0ba202211c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(N,D,R)$、$H=(M,d,S)$ 分别属于 $\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D},\\mathsf{RG}_{M,d}$，见 [[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]；$a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\operatorname{prodidx}_{a,b}$ 是下式构造的编号双射。$P_G,P_H$ 见 [[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]。$u\\in[N],v\\in[M],i\\in[D],j\\in[d]$；$R(u,i)=(u_R,i_R)$、$S(v,j)=(v_S,j_S)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(N,D,R)","display":false},{"tex":"H=(M,d,S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D},\\mathsf{RG}_{M,d}","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{prodidx}_{a,b}","display":false},{"tex":"P_G,P_H","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in[N],v\\in[M],i\\in[D],j\\in[d]","display":false},{"tex":"R(u,i)=(u_R,i_R)","display":false},{"tex":"S(v,j)=(v_S,j_S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{prodidx}_{a,b}(r,s)\\coloneqq(r-1)b+s\\quad((r,s)\\in[a]\\times[b]),\\qquad\\operatorname{prodidx}_{a,b}:[a]\\times[b]\\xrightarrow{\\sim}[ab].","display":true},{"tex":"R_\\otimes(\\operatorname{prodidx}_{N,M}(u,v),\\operatorname{prodidx}_{D,d}(i,j))\\coloneqq(\\operatorname{prodidx}_{N,M}(u_R,v_S),\\operatorname{prodidx}_{D,d}(i_R,j_S)),\\qquad G\\otimes H\\coloneqq(NM,Dd,R_\\otimes).","display":true},{"tex":"R_\\otimes:[NM]\\times[Dd]\\to[NM]\\times[Dd],\\qquad G\\otimes H\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{NM,Dd}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall u,u'\\in[N]\\ \\forall v,v'\\in[M]\\quad P_{G\\otimes H}(\\operatorname{prodidx}_{N,M}(u',v'),\\operatorname{prodidx}_{N,M}(u,v))=P_G(u',u)P_H(v',v).","display":true}],"bytes":1930,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-385","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-graph-power]]、[[28-df-graph-tensor-product]]、[[28-df-replacement-product]]、[[28-thm-tensor-product-expansion]]、[[28-thm-replacement-product-expansion]]、[[28-df-flat-source]]、[[28-lem-flat-source-convex-decomposition]]、[[28-df-branching-program]]、[[28-df-undirected-connectivity]]、[[28-thm-reingold]]、[[28-df-space-bounded-prg]]、[[28-thm-nisan-space-prg]]。"},{"id":"d2463524bbdba63f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G,H$ 与 $G\\otimes H$ 采用 [[28-df-graph-tensor-product]]；$\\lambda$ 是 [[28-df-spectral-expander]] 的绝对谱参数。"}],"outgoing":["0b6b8966305e02a9","1c9d3a0ba202211c"]}